  (text "SW1 ON: pole 1 puts EN_A at 0V (= pack A positive), pole 2 puts EN_B at +BATB; OFF opens both (R40 / R82 hold them low).  Chain B: Q22 (2N7002) conducts when ENB_G is high" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 261.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0b9f6aa6-42fe-5a6a-a89d-0f063203593c"))
  (text "and its source, J3.4, is at 0V, i.e. the module's plug is in (it straps pin 4 to pin 2): then R1 / R2 give Q1 Vgs = -Vsw/2 and +V is live.  ENB_G = EN_B through R81 1M, pulled to 0V by" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 266.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1e18f7ab-cbf9-55c3-a6f1-15301a233d30"))
  (text "U15B below 12.0 V (back above 12.8 V: R53 from +OUT) and by U17 while a brick is plugged in.  Chain A: Q11 (N, in pack A's negative) gets Vgs = pack A / 2 from R39 / R40 off EN_A;" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 271.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "21637cf1-15be-5caf-9e53-1dced3d3c595"))
  (text "U2B pulls the gate low below 12.0 V (R11 470k: back on at 12.9 V).  -V without 0V is harmless to the module, +V without 0V kills it, so only +V is interlocked (and the" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 276.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4737e0d1-41da-5327-bf13-cd19476c6e72"))
  (text "module's fault line reports a missing rail either way).  Gauge rails (box 2B) follow EN_A / EN_B, not the interlocks: both gauges show whenever the toggle is ON." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 281.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5841abc2-9736-5585-b231-9f7867c00597"))
  (rectangle (start 259.08 238.76) (end 396.24 284.48) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "4447e725-7b8e-510e-836e-b217e49af0a2"))
  (text "2B. GAUGE RAILS: +G = 0V THROUGH Q20, +GB = +BATB THROUGH Q23" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 260.35 242.57 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "03b9d463-a341-52d8-b5d5-91ab229cb7ba"))
