  (text "H1-H4 M3: pack standoffs below.  H5-H8 M2.5, 58 x 49 mm: a Raspberry Pi (3B+/4/5) on standoffs above the board." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 403.86 347.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0d456cc1-331c-591b-b2bc-ffa085485a37"))
  (text "Packs strapped under the board (two 20 mm straps through the slots), XT60 plugs to J7 / J8 and balance leads to J5 / J6 at the front edge." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 403.86 353.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0b23be42-a121-5de3-b8d8-926b7cf5a20f"))
  (text "J3 pin 4 (CAB) is strapped to pin 2 (0V) inside the module's plug: +V is enabled only with the plug in, so" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 403.86 358.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d19bb0db-33bd-5b45-b575-2a89ee78c241"))
  (text "the module never sees +V without 0V.  Toggle ON powers the module and the gauges; OFF leaves about" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 403.86 363.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "17fb4f21-805c-555c-9ed1-d9c06a0a122d"))
  (text "40 uA on the packs (balancers, charger sleep).  A brick plugged in disables the outputs (U17)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 403.86 368.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ea04e1c3-e11b-502c-84c8-66e4a5cdfb3c"))
  (text "-V floats whenever pack A is off (OFF, under-voltage), +V whenever pack B is or the plug is out or a" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 403.86 373.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8d5c2af3-ca50-514a-80c7-9c566d98d8a3"))
  (text "brick is in: the module's fault comparator reports a missing rail." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 403.86 378.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4a0f3cc3-4157-5715-a0d7-071d4bd5355a"))
  (rectangle (start 533.4 20.32) (end 706.12 314.96) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "ba74e0a5-0df1-52b7-bbc4-3d68ed45bd76"))
  (text "6. CHARGER ISLAND (floats on CGND): USB-C PD 20 V INPUT (CH224A), 3.3 V (TLV760), VBUS SWITCH (MCU), 4S BUCK CHARGER (CN3704, 1 A)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 534.67 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "47e44c95-ad27-55d8-a399-bda559d54fd8"))
