  (text "Everything in this box and in box 7 is referenced to CGND, which the relay K1 puts on GND (pack A) or on 0V (pack B); the brick is" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 535.94 261.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8b386bd3-fb06-57b0-91e4-797aeb2c1e6a"))
  (text "mains-isolated, so the island floating is fine.  J1 / U4: the CH224A asks a PD brick for 20 V (R24 120k on CFG1); its DP / DM stay" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 535.94 266.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b3edaea4-d540-57e6-b418-c67214d2f2c3"))
  (text "open, the USB data lines go to the MCU (DFU).  U18 makes 3.3 V from VBUS (5 V from a PC port, 20 V from the brick).  Q13 passes VBUS" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 535.94 271.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1189c807-8558-5dab-9177-35979ce73b4e"))
  (text "to the charger only while the MCU drives CHG_EN (R42 keeps it off in reset / DFU): the MCU power-cycles the charger at every pack swap" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 535.94 276.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5a170405-b049-5975-a4c7-b29a608cdcd2"))
  (text "so the CN3704 starts a fresh cycle (it would not restart on a pack above its 16.0 V recharge threshold).  U5: buck at 300 kHz, Q6 switch," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 535.94 281.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7046970d-e44c-54c0-87f9-b11d9fd299b6"))
  (text "D7 blocks the pack from the input, D8 freewheels, L1 22 uH, R25 + R26 = 0.2 R -> 1 A constant current into one pack at a time," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 535.94 287.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "63e3e956-17cd-5220-b4d7-89d914305323"))
  (text "16.8 V +-1 % constant voltage, termination at 9 % (92 mA), trickle at 150 mA below 11.2 V, over-voltage cut at 18.1 V.  RT1 10k NTC" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 535.94 292.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "220c9388-3197-5ebc-915d-b5a6af150f37"))
  (text "(board temperature; a 10k resistor disables it).  CHRG / DONE are read by the MCU.  Up to 2 A: R25 + R26 = 0.1 R, L1 20 uH, 45 W brick." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 535.94 297.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "91781f72-6d31-5ce0-8206-a4cb84feada4"))
  (rectangle (start 533.4 320.04) (end 762 487.68) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "1671c661-e2e5-5fa6-8498-ec0b3b74049f"))
  (text "7. CHARGE CONTROLLER (island): STM32F042F4P6 (USB DFU), RELAY K1 TO PACK A / B, PER-PACK CHARGING / DONE LEDs" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 534.67 323.85 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e6c8a03d-2435-5140-bea7-d204c4eefda6"))
